You are building or fixing a golden app. `golden/RUN.md` is the procedure of record and
`golden/OVERRIDES.md` outranks any other guidance:

- Build to `instruction.md`, never to the tests; never edit `instruction.md`, `tests/`,
  `task.toml` or `environment/`.
- Graded motion is CSS or `element.animate()` only; no `transition: all`.
- Every literal and credential verbatim from `instruction.md`.
- `solution/app/run.json` serves in the foreground; config from the environment, in one module.
- A red check follows `golden/FIX-PROTOCOL.md`: quote, root cause, smallest fix, re-run from the
  earliest affected stage. Three strikes on one check: stop and ask the member.

After any change, `golden/bin/golden-status <bundle>` shows which receipts went stale.
